Z||000036||Tigger||12-19-2001||09:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Raydar:<BR><B> ...and you're going to hold out on us, eh?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LoL, yes.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Well, ok, "heritage theme" and no it's not the SSR.  They're also going to try a pretty revolutionizing concept idea, probably won't happen in the next generation of vehicles, but is definitely interesting.<P>Only a few weeks before the show, it wouldn't be exciting if I gave away the suprises.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Watch for Bob in the Pontiac unveiling and reports of the other concepts!<BR>||||reg||1
